# Repo layout

Canonical docs at the repo root: `README.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `BUILD.md`, `AGENTS.md`.
`frontend/README.md` and `frontend/ARCHITECTURE.md` are frontend-only; use the root docs for the full stack.

## Where to work

- Backend: `backend/` — FastAPI (app version 1.2.0) on `:8000`
- Frontend: `frontend/` — Nuxt 4 SPA (`ssr: false`) on `:3000`
- Do **not** resurrect a vanilla `index.html` / `app.js` at the repo root
- Do **not** mount FastAPI `StaticFiles` to serve the Nuxt app

## Do not “fix” unasked

- SQLite + `create_all` (no Alembic)
- Bearer JWT in `localStorage` key `resume_ai_token` (no HttpOnly cookies)
- No pagination on `/api/resumes`
- No Docker or CI in this repo

Follow Rule #1. Use `.env.example` for names only. Never open `.env` or `*.db`.
